# The seed (apps/api/prisma/seed/curriculum.ts) reads the DSKP extracts: ship only the JSON, not the .md notes.
# The negation must come after `docs`. No `!docs/reference/dskp` line: it would re-include the .md files too.
!docs/reference/dskp/*.json
!packages/**/*.md
